{"inkVersion":21,"root":[["#","^background: boss_intro","/#","#","^thought","/#","^You finalise the system performance report at 10:40. Charts, appendix, the lot.","\n","#","^background: boss_intro","/#","#","^thought","/#","^Save to the shared drive, link it to Delia and the wider team, go and get a coffee.","\n","#","^background: boss_intro","/#","#","^thought","/#","^At 11:15 Delia is standing at your desk with her laptop open.","\n","#","^background: boss_scolding","/#","#","^character: delia, tired, right","/#","#","^speaker: Delia","/#","^\"This isn't what I was expecting.\"","\n","#","^background: boss_showing","/#","#","^thought","/#","^She turns the screen. It's the report, dated Tuesday, three charts short, the settlement figures un-reconciled. It's a draft you abandoned two days ago.","\n","#","^background: boss_intro","/#","#","^thought","/#","^Your name isn't on it. Pauline's is.","\n","#","^background: boss_scolding","/#","#","^character: delia, tired, right","/#","#","^speaker: Delia","/#","^\"Pauline's redone most of it from scratch. I'm not thrilled about where that leaves the afternoon.\"","\n","#","^background: boss_intro","/#","#","^thought","/#","^She isn't angry. That's somehow worse.","\n","ev","str","^\"That's not the version I sent. Check the file history.\"","/str","/ev",{"*":"0.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^\"Pauline must have overwritten it.\"","/str","/ev",{"*":"0.c-1","flg":20},"ev","str","^\"I'll fix it.\"","/str","/ev",{"*":"0.c-2","flg":20},"ev","str","^\"Can I ask Pauline what she was working from?\"","/str","/ev",{"*":"0.c-3","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"standing"},1,"-","/ev",{"VAR=":"standing","re":true},"ev",{"VAR?":"composure"},1,"-","/ev",{"VAR=":"composure","re":true},"ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"kept_receipts","re":true},"#","^character: delia, tired, right","/#","#","^speaker: Delia","/#","^\"I don't need a forensic investigation, I need the report.\"","\n","#","^background: boss_intro","/#","#","^thought","/#","^She's already looking at her phone.","\n","#","^speaker: Delia","/#","^\"Can you have it by four?\"","\n",{"->":"sc1_converge"},{"->":"0.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"standing"},2,"-","/ev",{"VAR=":"standing","re":true},"ev",{"VAR?":"composure"},1,"+","/ev",{"VAR=":"composure","re":true},"ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"named_pauline","re":true},"#","^background: boss_intro","/#","#","^thought","/#","^A pause.","\n","#","^character: delia, cool, right","/#","#","^speaker: Delia","/#","^\"Let's not do that.\"","\n","#","^character: delia, cool, right","/#","#","^speaker: Delia","/#","^\"Just get me the corrected one.\"","\n",{"->":"sc1_converge"},{"->":"0.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"composure"},2,"-","/ev",{"VAR=":"composure","re":true},"#","^character: delia, tired, right","/#","#","^speaker: Delia","/#","^\"Thank you.\"","\n","#","^background: boss_intro","/#","#","^thought","/#","^She means it. She's gone in four seconds.","\n",{"->":"sc1_converge"},{"->":"0.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"c-3":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"standing"},1,"-","/ev",{"VAR=":"standing","re":true},"ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"asked_pauline","re":true},"#","^character: delia, tired, right","/#","#","^speaker: Delia","/#","^\"Sure. After four.\"","\n",{"->":"sc1_converge"},{"->":"0.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"g-0":["done",null]}],"done",{"sc1_converge":["#","^background: openplan_morning","/#","#","^thought","/#","^You open the shared drive. There's one file. Modified 09:52 by Pauline.","\n","#","^background: openplan_morning","/#","#","^thought","/#","^There's no earlier version in the folder. There might have been, and there might not have been. You are not going to be able to find out this afternoon.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"asked_pauline"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"sc2_pauline"},{"->":".^.^.^.21"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n",{"->":"sc3_small_things"},{"->":".^.^.^.21"},null]}],"nop","\n",null],"sc2_pauline":[["#","^background: kitchenette","/#","#","^character: pauline, warm, left","/#","#","^thought","/#","^She's genuinely pleased to see you.","\n","#","^character: pauline, warm, left","/#","#","^speaker: Pauline","/#","^\"Oh — the perf report? Yeah, I found it Tuesday night and it was in rough shape, so I just took a run at it.\"","\n","#","^character: pauline, warm, left","/#","#","^speaker: Pauline","/#","^\"Was that a live one? God, I'm sorry, it looked like a stale draft.\"","\n","#","^character: pauline, warm, left","/#","#","^speaker: Pauline","/#","^\"Did you have a newer one somewhere? I would've just used yours.\"","\n","ev","str","^\"I sent the newer one this morning.\"","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^\"No, that was probably it.\"","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},"ev","str","^\"You could have asked me first.\"","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"composure"},1,"-","/ev",{"VAR=":"composure","re":true},"#","^character: pauline, warm, left","/#","#","^speaker: Pauline","/#","^\"Weird. Ping it to me and I'll tell Delia it was yours.\"","\n","#","^background: kitchenette","/#","#","^thought","/#","^She doesn't. Not out of malice — the day gets away from her, the same way it gets away from everyone.","\n",{"->":"sc3_small_things"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"standing"},1,"+","/ev",{"VAR=":"standing","re":true},"ev",{"VAR?":"composure"},2,"-","/ev",{"VAR=":"composure","re":true},"#","^background: kitchenette","/#","#","^thought","/#","^You watch yourself do it. She is relieved and you are the reason.","\n",{"->":"sc3_small_things"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"standing"},1,"-","/ev",{"VAR=":"standing","re":true},"ev",{"VAR?":"composure"},1,"+","/ev",{"VAR=":"composure","re":true},"#","^character: pauline, warm, left","/#","#","^speaker: Pauline","/#","^\"You're right. That's fair.\"","\n","#","^background: kitchenette","/#","#","^thought","/#","^She says it immediately and completely, and it changes nothing, because the report still says Pauline.","\n",{"->":"sc3_small_things"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"sc3_small_things":[["#","^background: slack_ui","/#","#","^thought","/#","^The #platform-eng thread is arguing about connection pooling. You post the actual answer, with a link to the config.","\n","#","^background: slack_ui","/#","#","^thought","/#","^Nothing.","\n","#","^background: slack_ui","/#","#","^thought","/#","^Forty minutes later the thread resolves without you, in the direction you pointed it.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"composure"},1,"-","/ev",{"VAR=":"composure","re":true},"#","^background: slack_ui","/#","#","^thought","/#","^You DM Fiona asking for ten minutes on a deploy issue.","\n","#","^background: slack_ui","/#","#","^speaker: Fiona","/#","^\"sure — what do i get in return 😉\"","\n","ev","str","^\"A working deploy.\"","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^\"lol\"","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},"ev","str","^Close the DM. Work it out yourself.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"standing"},1,"+","/ev",{"VAR=":"standing","re":true},"ev",{"VAR?":"composure"},1,"-","/ev",{"VAR=":"composure","re":true},"#","^background: slack_ui","/#","#","^speaker: Fiona","/#","^\"hahaha ok ok. 5 mins.\"","\n","#","^background: slack_ui","/#","#","^thought","/#","^She helps. She's good. It was a joke.","\n",{"->":"sc4_pr"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"composure"},2,"-","/ev",{"VAR=":"composure","re":true},"#","^background: slack_ui","/#","#","^speaker: Fiona","/#","^\"gimme 5.\"","\n","#","^background: slack_ui","/#","#","^thought","/#","^She helps. She's good. It was a joke.","\n",{"->":"sc4_pr"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"standing"},1,"-","/ev",{"VAR=":"standing","re":true},"ev",{"VAR?":"composure"},1,"-","/ev",{"VAR=":"composure","re":true},"#","^background: slack_ui","/#","#","^thought","/#","^You're still on it when the sync starts.","\n",{"->":"sc4_pr"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"sc4_pr":["#","^background: home_evening","/#","#","^thought","/#","^21:40. You open a PR for the pooling fix — the one from the thread nobody answered.","\n","#","^background: home_evening","/#","#","^thought","/#","^Morning: forty-one comments. Naming conventions. A suggestion to split a nine-line function. Two people asking whether you'd considered an approach you'd considered and rejected in the description.","\n","#","^background: home_evening","/#","#","^thought","/#","^One of them is Pauline, and it's the most useful review on there. She's spent twenty minutes on it. She's being kind.","\n","#","^background: home_evening","/#","#","^thought","/#","^Ellie's PR, opened the same night, four files changed.","\n","#","^background: home_evening","/#","#","^thought","/#","^LGTM.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"composure"},1,"-","/ev",{"VAR=":"composure","re":true},"#","^background: home_evening","/#","#","^thought","/#","^The corrected report goes out at 09:02, in a shared folder with no author field.","\n","#","^module: quiz3","/#","end",null],"global decl":["ev",0,{"VAR=":"standing"},0,{"VAR=":"composure"},false,{"VAR=":"asked_pauline"},false,{"VAR=":"named_pauline"},false,{"VAR=":"kept_receipts"},"/ev","end",null]}],"listDefs":{}}